  "notes": "A two-storey town house 8 m by 7 m, 8 m to the top of a stepped parapet, white with a cobalt tile panel over a turquoise dado. An open door under a striped canopy on local -Z leads to a shop with a stone counter, a back room with a hearth and stairs up through two floors to a terrace with a small terracotta pergola; two upper balconies have iron railings. White limewash with cobalt trim since v2.",
